     6586             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-cost-sum      )  CHR(9)
     6587             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-cost-vat      )  CHR(9)
     6588             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-cost-sum-novat)  CHR(9)
     6589             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-sale-sum      )  CHR(9)
     6590             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-sale-other    )  CHR(9)
     6591             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-sale-vat      )  CHR(9)
     6592             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-sale-slt      )  CHR(9)
     6593             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-disc          )  CHR(9)   CHR(9)
     6594             excel-sum (accum TOTAL by obj-list.obj-code ff-crsa-sum      )  chr(10).
     6595   End.
     6596    if n-no > 1 then do:
     6597     if c-nn <>  ?  then do :
